<title>UK: TENNIS-BRITAIN LEAD EGYPT 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BRITAIN LEAD EGYPT 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain lead Egypt 2-0 in their</p>
<p>Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, third round tie after the</p>
<p>opening singles matches on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski beat Tamer El Sawy 6-2 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Tim Henman beat Amr Ghoneim 6-0 6-4 7-5</p>
</text>
